00:46:23,320 --> 00:46:29,880
Yeah, YouTube is just a little—

798
00:46:29,880 --> 00:46:30,920
pure.

799
00:46:30,920 --> 00:46:33,920
Pure water, that's what YouTube is.

800
00:46:33,920 --> 00:46:36,480
