878
00:49:37,520 --> 00:49:38,560
Yeah, like—

879
00:49:38,560 --> 00:49:42,280
My eyes are really sensitive.

880
00:49:42,280 --> 00:49:44,780
I'm very sensitive to light.

881
00:49:44,780 --> 00:49:48,420
