Yeah, so sometimes I wear sunglasses. Yep.

902
00:51:02,590 --> 00:51:04,580
That's right.

903
00:51:08,080 --> 00:51:12,000
And Korone-san also wears glasses sometimes, yeah.

904
00:51:12,000 --> 00:51:13,880
Yeah, sometimes.

905
