949
00:53:44,600 --> 00:53:48,900
If it doesn't come with garlic, I can just order it without.

950
00:53:48,900 --> 00:53:53,140
So just order it without garlic then.

951
00:53:53,140 --> 00:53:55,440
Right.

952
00:53:55,440 --> 00:53:59,780
Yeah, if that's an option, I'd go without garlic.

953
00:53:59,780 --> 00:54:03,540
