954
00:54:03,540 --> 00:54:06,840
Isn't it one of those things where the garlic is the whole point?

955
00:54:06,840 --> 00:54:09,180
Like, that's what makes it Jiro ramen?

956
00:54:09,180 --> 00:54:10,930
I don't really know though.

957
00:54:10,930 --> 00:54:12,050
Like—

958
00:54:12,050 --> 00:54:20,260
