986
00:56:28,310 --> 00:56:31,870
Hmm.

987
00:56:31,870 --> 00:56:35,770
I see. You look like you've got strong shoulders — oh, you do!

988
00:56:35,770 --> 00:56:39,730
My shoulders are strong, for real.

989
