Hahaha! What kind of peace sign is this? Like this...

1011
00:59:01,490 --> 00:59:09,660
Hehehe! This is great, this is great!

1012
00:59:09,660 --> 00:59:18,100
Yeah! Rock-paper-scissors, shoot!

1013
00:59:19,520 --> 00:59:24,650
Rock-paper-scissors!

1014
00:59:26,450 --> 00:59:30,250
Rock-paper-scissors!

1015
